# Soline converter — packaging exclusions (mirrors SHIPPING_MANIFEST.md).
# Applied by `npm pack` / `npm publish`. Any other packaging step (zip, installer,
# `git archive`) MUST apply the same list. Files are excluded from the PACKAGE only —
# they stay in the working tree for the licensed dev seat.
#
# COMPLIANCE (docs/INTEROP_COMPLIANCE.md): Soline redistributes NO InnoDraw/Raumplan
# vendor files. The PDP base comes from the customer's own install at convert time.

# --- Vendor-origin PDP bases + extracted element records (PRIMARY exposure) ---
templates/dr/base/
templates/dr/native/
templates/dr/items/
templates/dr/wall*.pdp

# --- Dev corpus + generated outputs (owner's real vendor exports + our test output) ---
analysis/out/
out/
out_test/
out_health/
inbox/
research/
_LATEST/
_baseline_preview.html

# --- Standard non-ship ---
node_modules/
.claude/
desktop.ini
**/desktop.ini
_*.js
